%% Drain and refill — Config, Secrets & Multi-Environment, lab exercise 4 ("You'll end with").
%% With all three probes set the Route answers 200; a readiness probe on a 404 path plus a scale to
%% 0 and back to 1 leaves no ready pod, so the Service has no endpoints and the Route returns 503;
%% restoring /q/health/ready puts the pod back in rotation.
%% Shape (diagram-size-guard): LR, longest chain 3 nodes, no subgraph, labels at most 2 lines.
flowchart LR
  OK["3 probes set<br/>Route 200"] -->|"readiness on a 404 path"| DOWN["no ready pod<br/>Route 503"]
  DOWN -->|"restore /q/health/ready"| BACK["pod back in rotation<br/>Route 200"]
  classDef ok fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#137333,color:#0d652d;
  classDef bad fill:#fce8e6,stroke:#c5221f,color:#a50e0e;
  class OK,BACK ok;
  class DOWN bad;
